---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Falck | Setup Concierge"
  description="A friendly setup flow that explains every step and keeps your team confident."
  theme="light"
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-24 pb-20">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 backdrop-grid opacity-60"></div>
      <div class="absolute -top-20 left-[12%] h-[320px] w-[320px] rounded-full bg-emerald-300/40 blur-[140px] glow-pulse"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-[-25%] right-[6%] h-[420px] w-[420px] rounded-full bg-sky-300/40 blur-[160px] float-soft"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6 reveal">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/70 px-4 py-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-600 border border-white/80">
          Setup Concierge
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Setup that feels like a guide, not a hurdle</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
          Falck checks requirements, helps you add missing pieces, and keeps you calm through every step. No wobbly shell
          commands, no guessing, just progress. It is like having a patient teammate who never says "just run this.".
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <Button href="/download">Download Falck</Button>
          <Button href="/features" variant="secondary">Back to the tour</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] items-center">
      <div class="space-y-4 reveal">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-emerald-500">Clear steps</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Know what is happening the whole time</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Falck explains why each step matters, highlights missing requirements, and keeps you safe with checks before
          running anything. No "mysterious terminal output" jump scares.
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            Friendly prerequisites and install prompts
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            Secret prompts with plain-language explanations
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            Always know what is safe to run
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="app-window reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="app-window-bar">
          <span>Falck Desktop</span>
          <span>Setup Concierge</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-400">
            <span>Setup status</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-500">Ready</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-2">
            <div class="surface-muted px-4 py-3 text-sm">
              <p class="font-semibold">Checklist</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">2 of 2 tools verified</p>
            </div>
            <div class="surface-muted px-4 py-3 text-sm">
              <p class="font-semibold">Secrets</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Falck explains what each key is for</p>
            </div>
            <div class="surface-dark px-4 py-3 text-sm">
              <p class="font-semibold">Launch ready</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-emerald-100/70">One click to start</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100/80 bg-emerald-50 px-4 py-3 text-xs text-emerald-700">
            Calm setup energy: "We verified Node so you do not have to."
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="surface p-6 reveal">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-emerald-500">Prereqs</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Checks before chaos</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
          Falck runs prerequisite checks and calls out missing tools before anything breaks. Think of it as a friendly
          bouncer for your local environment.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="surface p-6 reveal-delay-1">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-slate-500">Secrets</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Secrets without the drama</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
          Falck asks for only what it needs, explains why, and keeps secrets in memory. Your team stays safe and sane.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="surface p-6 reveal-delay-2">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-slate-500">Launch</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">One click to run</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
          Setup steps are defined in the repo, so launching is a single button. No copy-paste, no "works on my machine."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto px-6 pb-28">
    <div class="surface p-10 md:p-12 text-center reveal">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-400">Next up</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Share updates with confidence</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Once setup is done, Falck makes sharing changes simple and safe for everyone.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <Button href="/features/share-updates">Share updates</Button>
        <Button href="/features/idea-studio" variant="secondary">Back to Idea Studio</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
